-water-sprouts-healthy-growth\"><h2 class=\"font-bold text-base leading-snug mb-2 group-hover:text-[var(--color-primary)] transition-colors line-clamp-2\">Managing Tree Suckers &amp; Water Sprouts for Healthy Growth</h2></a><p class=\"text-sm text-[var(--color-muted-fg)] line-clamp-2 flex-1\">Learn how to identify, remove, and prevent tree suckers and water sprouts. Expert tips for promoting healthy tree growth and maintaining a beautiful landscape.</p><div class=\"mt-3 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-[var(--color-muted-fg)]\"><span></span><time dateTime=\"2026-08-29 00:33:18\">Aug 29, 2026</time></div></div></article><article class=\"group flex flex-col bg-white border border-[var(--color-border)] rounded-xl overflow-hidden hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><a class=\"block relative aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden bg-[var(--color-muted)]\" href=\"/blog/best-grass-seed-for-ct-sun-and-shade\"><img alt=\"Best Grass Seed for CT: Top Picks for Sun &amp; Shade\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"https://s.alicdn.com/@sc02/kf/Ad945a96cb83944568e70ad6b2ba16182B.jpg\"/></a><div class=\"p-4 flex flex-col flex-1\"><a class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-[var(--color-primary)] uppercase tracking-wide mb-2 hover:underline\" href=\"/categories/grass-types\">Grass Types</a><a href=\"/blog/best-grass-seed-for-ct-sun-and-shade\"><h2 class=\"font-bold text-base leading-snug mb-2 group-hover:text-[var(--color-primary)] transition-colors line-clamp-2\">Best Grass Seed for CT: Top Picks for Sun &amp; Shade</h2></a><p class=\"text-sm text-[var(--color-muted-fg)] line-clamp-2 flex-1\">Discover the best grass seed for Connecticut lawns in both sun and shade. Expert picks, growing tips, and maintenance advice for a lush CT lawn.</p><div class=\"mt-3 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-[var(--color-muted-fg)]\"><span>Robert Hayes</span><time dateTime=\"2026-08-29 00:26:57\">Aug 29, 2026</time></div></div></article><article class=\"group flex flex-col bg-white border border-[var(--color-border)] rounded-xl overflow-hidden hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><a class=\"block relative aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden bg-[var(--color-muted)]\" href=\"/blog/sunday-lawn-care-organic\"><img alt=\"Sunday Lawn Care Organic: The Complete Guide to Natural, Chemical-Free Lawn Treatment\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"https://s.alicdn.com/@sc02/kf/A58780092c8ff42379ae52f893ade9c26Q.jpg\"/></a><div class=\"p-4 flex flex-col flex-1\"><a class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-[var(--color-primary)] uppercase tracking-wide mb-2 hover:underline\" href=\"/categories/lawn-care\">Lawn Care</a><a href=\"/blog/sunday-lawn-care-organic\"><h2 class=\"font-bold text-base leading-snug mb-2 group-hover:text-[var(--color-primary)] transition-colors line-clamp-2\">Sunday Lawn Care Organic: The Complete Guide to Natural, Chemical-Free Lawn Treatment</h2></a><p class=\"text-sm text-[var(--color-muted-fg)] line-clamp-2 flex-1\">Discover how Sunday Lawn Care&#x27;s organic approach can transform your yard with natural ingredients, eco-friendly products, and simple seasonal routines.</p><div class=\"mt-3 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-[var(--color-muted-fg)]\"><span>Anna Kowalski</span><time dateTime=\"2026-08-29 00:23:05\">Aug 29, 2026</time></div></div></article></div></section><section class=\"bg-[var(--color-muted)] py-14 px-4\"><div class=\"max-w-[1280px] mx-auto\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-2 justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-calendar text-[var(--color-primary)]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M16 2v4\"></path><rect width=\"18\" height=\"18\" x=\"3\" y=\"4\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M3 10h18\"></path></svg><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold\">Lawn Care by the Season</h2></div><p class=\"text-[var(--color-muted-fg)] text-center mb-8 max-w-xl mx-auto\">Timing is everything. Here&#x27;s what matters most each season.</p><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border p-6 bg-emerald-50 border-emerald-200 text-emerald-800\"><div class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\">Spring</div><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed opacity-80\">Aerate, overseed, and apply the first fertilizer of the year.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border p-6 bg-amber-50 border-amber-200 text-amber-800\"><div class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\">Summer</div><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed opacity-80\">Raise mowing height, water deeply, watch for fungal disease.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border p-6 bg-orange-50 border-orange-200 text-orange-800\"><div class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\">Fall</div><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed opacity-80\">Most critical for cool-season grasses — overseed + slow-release fertilizer.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border p-6 bg-blue-50 border-blue-200 text-blue-800\"><div class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\">Winter</div><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed opacity-80\">Clean equipment, test soil, plan amendments for spring.</p></div></div><p class=\"text-center mt-8 text-[var(--color-muted-fg)]\">Not sure where to start?<!-- --> <a class=\"text-[var(--color-primary)] font-semibold hover:underline\" href=\"/categories/lawn-care\">Browse lawn care guides</a> <!-- -->or<!-- --> <a class=\"text-[var(--color-primary)] font-semibold hover:underline\" href=\"/blog\">see all articles</a>.</p></div></section><section class=\"max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-14\"><div class=\"max-w-none\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-4\">Why a Healthy Lawn Starts With the Right Knowledge</h2><p class=\"text-[var(--color-muted-fg)] leading-relaxed mb-4\">A beautiful lawn doesn&#x27;t happen by accident. It takes consistent care — the right mowing height, a reliable watering schedule, timely fertilization, and knowing how to spot trouble before it spreads. Whether you&#x27;re dealing with a patchy backyard or maintaining a lush garden, the principles are the same: understand your grass type, respect the seasons, and act before small problems become expensive ones.</p><p class=\"text-[var(--color-muted-fg)] leading-relaxed mb-4\">LawnsGuide cuts through the noise. We focus on practical, actionable guides — from<!-- --> <a class=\"text-[var(--color-primary)] hover:underline font-medium\" href=\"/categories/lawn-care\">seasonal lawn care schedules</a> <!-- -->to<!-- --> <a class=\"text-[var(--color-primary)] hover:underline font-medium\" href=\"/categories/pest-control\">identifying and eliminating lawn pests</a>. Every guide is designed to give you a clear next step, not just general advice.</p></div></section><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"bg-[var(--color-primary-dark)] text-white mt-auto\"><div class=\"max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8\"><div class=\"lg:col-span-2\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-2 font-bold text-xl mb-3\" href=\"/\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-leaf\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11 20A7 7 0 0 1 9.8 6.1C15.5 5 17 4.48 19 2c1 2 2 4.18 2 8 0 5.5-4.78 10-10 10Z\"></path><path d=\"M2 21c0-3 1.85-5.36 5.08-6C9.5 14.52 12 13 13 12\"></path></svg> LawnsGuide</a><p class=\"text-sm text-white/70 max-w-xs leading-relaxed\">Exper